# Rakdos, Patron of Chaos: at Bot1's end step target opponent may sacrifice two nonland, nontoken permanents (CR 701.21, 608.2d). On
# turn 3 Bot2 controls two Memnites (and has an Island), so it can pay: it accepts, chooses both Memnites, and Bot1 draws nothing.
# Turn 1's end step (Bot2 has nothing, so cannot pay) already drew two, so the hand count shows only the turn-3 draw step.

